cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use plotomics in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "plotomics: High-Performance Bioinformatics Visualizations"
abstract: >-
  Lightweight, GPU-accelerated bioinformatics visualization components with a
  single TypeScript core exposed to R (via htmlwidgets) and Python (via
  anywidget). Seventeen components covering differential expression, expression
  and clustered heatmaps, marker dot plots, stacked violins, single-cell
  embeddings, spatial tissue maps, oncoprints, protein domain lollipops,
  Kaplan-Meier curves, mutational signature profiles, UpSet plots, treemaps,
  networks, Hi-C contact matrices and genome browsers. Built for large datasets
  that stay interactive in the browser, the RStudio Viewer, Jupyter, Quarto and
  Shiny.
type: software
